        {
          "title": "1. Add missing exports to src/shared/index.ts (errors, file-status, gh-api-utils, interpolation-engine, string-utils, type-guards, xfg-template). 2. Add IGitOps, IPRStrategy, GitAuthOptions, GitOpsOptions to src/vcs/index.ts exports. 3. Redirect FileAction imports in sync/types.ts, sync/commit-message.ts, sync/file-sync-orchestrator.ts from vcs/pr-creator.ts to vcs/index.ts or vcs/types.ts. 4. Move GitOpsOptions to vcs/types.ts if not already there, update sync/types.ts import. 5. Inject GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY path into github-summary.ts instead of reading process.env directly. 6. Run npm run test:typecheck to verify no broken imports.",
          "detail": "Audit barrel files in src/shared/ and src/vcs/index.ts. Remove re-exports unused outside the module. Add missing exports used by src/sync/.",
          "issue_refs": [],
          "effort": "medium",
          "done": true
        }
