          "title": "Add src/repo/index.ts barrel and redirect imports away from detector.ts",
          "detail": "src/repo/ currently has detector.ts, metadata-provider.ts, types.ts, utils.ts but no barrel file. Create a new barrel (index.ts) in src/repo/ re-exporting from src/repo/types.ts (RepoInfo and platform-specific variants), src/repo/utils.ts (isGitHubRepo, assertGitHubRepo, getRepoDisplayName), src/repo/detector.ts (detectRepoInfo), and src/repo/metadata-provider.ts (GitHubRepoMetadataProvider plus IRepoMetadataProvider). Redirect the ~43 importers of '../repo/detector.js' under src/cli/, src/sync/, and src/vcs/ to the new barrel where appropriate.",
          "effort": "medium",
          "issue_refs": [
            "repo_missing_index_barrel"
          ],
          "done": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Relocate sanitize-utils into src/vcs/ and move unified-summary into src/cli/",
          "detail": "git mv src/shared/sanitize-utils.ts into src/vcs/ and update the three src/vcs/github-pr-strategy.ts, src/vcs/azure-pr-strategy.ts, src/vcs/gitlab-pr-strategy.ts imports (plus test/unit/sanitize-utils.test.ts). git mv src/output/unified-summary.ts into src/cli/ and update src/cli/sync-command.ts import. Note: src/output/ currently has no index.ts barrel, so no re-export cleanup needed there.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": [
            "sanitize_utils_vcs_only",
            "unified_summary_is_cli_stitcher_in_output"
          ],
          "done": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Stage test/unit/ directory migration to mirror src/ in four validated batches",
          "detail": "Run npm test between each batch: (1) vcs tests move into test/unit/vcs/; (2) settings tests (ruleset/labels/repo-settings/code-scanning diff/formatter/processor) move into test/unit/settings/<kind>/; (3) shared-utility tests move into test/unit/shared/; (4) verify no remaining flat-root tests for modules that already have a subdirectory.",
