          "detail": "Before touching src/sync/commit-push-manager.ts or the three src/vcs/*-pr-strategy.ts files in step 2, run 'desloppify show review --status resolved --no-budget' and grep for error_consistency to list the 101 resolved patterns. Confirm branch_protection_string_match (substring match in commit-push-manager.ts) and close_existing_pr_false_is_ambiguous (ambiguous boolean return in src/vcs/github-pr-strategy.ts closeExistingPR) are materially new \u2014 not restatements of prior resolutions. Otherwise skip --false-positive with note.",
          "effort": "trivial",
          "issue_refs": [
            "branch_protection_string_match",
            "close_existing_pr_false_is_ambiguous"
          ],
          "done": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Replace substring match with pattern array and discriminate close-existing-PR returns",
          "detail": "src/sync/commit-push-manager.ts:104-109: add BRANCH_PROTECTION_ERROR_PATTERNS regex array in src/shared/retry-utils.ts mirroring DEFAULT_PERMANENT_ERROR_PATTERNS and test via .test() instead of message.includes. src/vcs/github-pr-strategy.ts, azure-pr-strategy.ts, gitlab-pr-strategy.ts: change closeExistingPR to return a discriminated result ({ status: 'no_pr' } | { status: 'closed' } | { status: 'close_failed'; message }) or split into hasExistingPR + closeExistingPR.",
          "effort": "medium",
          "issue_refs": [
            "review::.::holistic::error_consistency::branch_protection_string_match",
            "review::.::holistic::error_consistency::close_existing_pr_false_is_ambiguous"
          ],
          "done": true
        }
      ]
