          "report": "{\"executive_summary\":\"Strict score improved 88.3\u219288.5 after fixing 12 items. Fresh blind review scored all 20 dimensions, importing 20 new findings. Five dimensions at 82.0 floor.\",\"score_trend\":\"improving\",\"debt_trend\":\"shrinking\",\"focus_dimensions\":[\"abstraction_fitness\",\"low_level_elegance\",\"mid_level_elegance\",\"naming_quality\",\"test_strategy\"],\"observe_guidance\":\"Focus on 20 new findings. Group by dimension. Identify quick wins vs architectural.\",\"reflect_guidance\":\"Prioritize fixes that improve multiple low-scoring dimensions. receiveMigration decomposition already done.\",\"organize_guidance\":\"Cluster by fix locality. Single-file fixes first.\",\"sense_check_guidance\":\"Verify no duplicate findings. Check receiveMigration correctly marked fixed.\"}",
